Package: unmasked
Title: Unmasking the Data: Exploring Data with R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bella", "Luzak", , "Bella.Luzak@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package unmasked allows for an easy way to calculate the proportion in a percent of the number of inputs per group. This function will take each group's count and divide by the total count in the data set, providing an accurate proportional representation of the data.
